{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And I will draw from the spirit that is upon you.</b> And did the Holy One, blessed be He, not have another spirit for the seventy elders, unless He took it from Moses? Rather, thus did the Holy One, blessed be He, say to Him: I say to you — you shall judge My people, and I have given you wisdom to judge them, and I have placed My spirit upon you, and you said, 'I cannot bear it alone' — by your life, from your spirit shall be given to them."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:17:26.673809642Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}